"旧工作流中的 `card_name`、`class` 和参数键保持不变；旧版顶层参数与当前 "
"`params` 对象都可读取。"
msgstr ""

#~ msgid "空位缺陷生成（Vacancy Defect Generation）"
#~ msgstr "Vacancy Defect Generation"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "按数量或比例删除原子，快速生成低到高缺陷强度的空位结构分布。支持 Sobol / "
#~ "Uniform 两种随机引擎，可选 count 或 fraction 两种主模式，并可选择固定空位"
#~ "数或随机空位数。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Remove atoms by count or fraction to generate vacancy configurations over "
#~ "a range of defect concentrations. Choose Sobol or uniform sampling, count "
#~ "or fraction mode, and fixed or randomized vacancy counts."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Vacancy Defect Generation`：统计驱动，按整体比例/数量生成空位，适合快速覆"
#~ "盖空位密度分布"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Vacancy Defect Generation` is statistical: it samples global counts or "
#~ "fractions to cover a vacancy-density distribution."

#~ msgid "`Random Vacancy`：规则驱动，按元素+group 精确删除位点，适合定向研究"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Random Vacancy` is rule driven: it removes sites by element and group "
#~ "for targeted studies."

#~ msgid "操作示例"
#~ msgstr "Example workflow"

#~ msgid "场景：模型把空位构型全部预测成接近完美晶体"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Scenario: Vacancy configurations are predicted like a perfect crystal"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "你在 100 原子的 Fe 超胞上训练了一个 NEP，训练集里只有弛豫好的完美晶体。模"
#~ "型推理一个含 1 个空位的构型时，能量几乎和完美晶体一样——模型没学过\"少了一"
#~ "个原子\"是什么后果。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "A NEP trained only on relaxed perfect 100-atom Fe cells assigns nearly "
#~ "the same energy to a single-vacancy configuration because no vacancy-"
#~ "centered environments were labeled."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**诊断思路：** 模型在完美晶体上收敛是因为训练集只有完美晶体。空位附近原子"
#~ "的力场完全不同：键断了一半，局域电子密度变化大。需要往训练集里加入从 1 个"
#~ "空位到 ~5% 浓度的分布，让模型覆盖低/中/高缺陷密度段。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Diagnosis:** Atoms adjacent to a vacancy have different coordination "
#~ "and forces. Add relaxed and labeled structures spanning single vacancies "
#~ "through the intended concentration range, rather than relying on perfect-"
#~ "crystal data."

#~ msgid "**输入：** 一个 100 原子的 Fe 超胞"
#~ msgstr "**Input:** A 100-atom Fe supercell."

#~ msgid "**目标：** 用 fraction 模式生成 5% 空位浓度，每帧 50 个随机落点版本"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Objective:** Generate 50 site arrangements at 5% vacancy fraction."

#~ msgid "**参数设置：**"
#~ msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#~ msgid "`Vacancy Fraction`：勾选"
#~ msgstr "Enable `Vacancy Fraction`."

#~ msgid "`Vacancy Fraction`：`[0.05]`（100 原子里精确删除 5 个空位）"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Set `Vacancy Fraction` to `[0.05]`, corresponding to five removed atoms "
#~ "here."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出：** 50 个空位结构，每个都删除 5 个原子，但空位落点不同，带 "
#~ "`Vac(n=5)` 标签"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output:** Fifty structures with five vacancies at different sites, "
#~ "labeled `Vac(n=5)`."

#~ msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
#~ msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#~ msgid "重训后用含空位的测试集推理，力 MAE 应对空位近邻原子也有合理精度"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "After DFT labeling and retraining, evaluate force errors specifically on "
#~ "vacancy-neighbor atoms."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "如果低浓度 OK 但高浓度崩，说明训练集高浓度样本不够——增加 "
#~ "`concentration_condition`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If low concentrations pass but higher concentrations fail, extend the "
#~ "labeled concentration range deliberately."

#~ msgid "如果样本覆盖感觉不均匀，换 Sobol 引擎再跑一批对比"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If a small sample has uneven count/site coverage, compare with Sobol "
#~ "sampling."

#~ msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
#~ msgstr "When to add this card"

#~ msgid "**加：**"
#~ msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#~ msgid "需要快速覆盖\"少了一个原子\"对力/能量的影响"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Vacancy-induced energy and force changes need broad initial coverage"

#~ msgid "训练集只有完美晶体，需要低/中/高缺陷密度梯度"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The dataset has only perfect crystals and needs a vacancy-density "
#~ "progression"

#~ msgid "不需要按元素类型区分空位来源"
#~ msgstr "Vacancy sites need not be distinguished by element or group"

#~ msgid "**不加：**"
#~ msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#~ msgid "需要精确控制删哪种元素 → 用 `Random Vacancy`"
#~ msgstr "Removal must target an element or group; use `Random Vacancy`"

#~ msgid "缺陷浓度 >20%——此时结构通常已剧烈变形，需先确认是否物理上有意义"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The requested concentration exceeds 20%, where the intended physical "
#~ "meaning should be reassessed"

#~ msgid "空位数量"
#~ msgstr "Vacancy amount"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 1。count 模式下的空位数量，范围 1-8。直接指定每个结构删几个原"
#~ "子——适合你已经想好确切数字的场景。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `1`, range 1-8. Number removed in count mode. Use when the "
#~ "exact vacancy count is the controlled variable."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`bool`，默认 true。打开时按绝对空位数删除，不同输入的缺陷数始终保持一致；"
#~ "关掉后切到浓度模式，不同超胞尺寸下自动保持相同缺陷比例。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default `true`. Enabled uses an absolute count across inputs; "
#~ "disabled uses a fraction so different cell sizes retain approximately the "
#~ "same concentration."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 0.0。fraction 模式下的空位比例，如 0.02 约等于删掉 2% 的原"
#~ "子。推荐范围 0.005-0.08。比例太小可能一个原子都删不到，比例太大结构容易"
#~ "崩。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `0.0`. Vacancy fraction, for example 0.02 for about 2%. "
#~ "Values around 0.005-0.08 are a typical starting band; very small cells "
#~ "may round to zero, while large fractions can destroy the framework."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `fixed`。`fixed` 精确按住上面设置的数量删；`random` 在 1 到设"
#~ "定值之间随机。你需要固定空位数量做对照实验就选 fixed，想覆盖更多空位分布的"
#~ "多样性就选 random。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `fixed`. `fixed` removes the configured amount; `random` "
#~ "samples an amount from 1 through that maximum. Use fixed for controlled "
#~ "comparisons and random for count diversity."

#~ msgid "采样和预算"
#~ msgstr "Sampling and budget"

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 1。`0` = Sobol 准随机序列，`1` = Uniform 均匀随机。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `1`. `0` selects a Sobol low-discrepancy sequence; `1` "
#~ "selects uniform random sampling."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "样本少时 Sobol 对空位数量和位置的覆盖更均衡；大批量（100+）时两者差异很"
#~ "小，Uniform 更快。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Sobol can distribute counts and positions more evenly in a small design. "
#~ "At 100 or more samples, the difference from uniform sampling is usually "
#~ "smaller."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 1。每输入帧生成多少个空位版本。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `1`. Number of vacancy variants generated per input frame."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "10~50 够轻量补样，50~100 做常规覆盖，上了 100 建议接一张 `FPS Filter`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Use roughly 10-50 for a light addition and 50-100 for broader coverage; "
#~ "above that, consider `FPS Filter` to control redundancy."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`bool`，默认 false。打开后固定 seed → 同参同输入可复现。需要对比实验时开"
#~ "着，纯探索可以关。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default `false`. Enable with a fixed seed for reproducible "
#~ "comparisons."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 0。随机种子值。"
#~ msgstr "`int`, default `0`. Random seed value."

#~ msgid "生效条件：`use_seed=True`。"
#~ msgstr "Active only when `use_seed=True`."

#~ msgid "保守（Safe，Sobol 引擎，2% 浓度，50 个输出）"
#~ msgstr "Safe (Sobol, 2% fraction, 50 outputs)"

#~ msgid "平衡（Balanced，Uniform 引擎，5% 浓度，50 个输出）"
#~ msgstr "Balanced (uniform, 5% fraction, 50 outputs)"

#~ msgid "探索（Exploration，Sobol，10% 浓度，100 个输出）"
#~ msgstr "Exploration (Sobol, 10% fraction, 100 outputs)"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Super Cell` → `Vacancy Defect Generation`：先扩胞再删，避免小胞里空位相互"
#~ "作用太强"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Super Cell` -> `Vacancy Defect Generation`: enlarge first to reduce "
#~ "vacancy-image interactions"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Vacancy Defect Generation` → `Insert Defect`：空位 + 插隙，互补缺陷族"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Vacancy Defect Generation` -> `Insert Defect`: combine vacancy and "
#~ "interstitial families"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Vacancy Defect Generation` → `Random Vacancy`：先覆盖密度分布，再补定向规"
#~ "则删除"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Vacancy Defect Generation` -> `Random Vacancy`: cover global density, "
#~ "then add targeted removals"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出结构数远少于预期。** 空位数为 0 时不会生成。检查浓度模式下 "
#~ "`concentration * n_atoms` 是否≥1。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Far fewer outputs than expected.** No structure is emitted for zero "
#~ "removals. Ensure fraction times atom count rounds to at least one."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**空位太多导致骨架崩坏。** 浓度模式 `0.10` 以上已到强缺陷区。先检查是否有"
#~ "孤立原子或明显断裂，再决定是否回调。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**The framework collapses at high vacancy count.** Fractions above 0.10 "
#~ "are strongly defective. Inspect connectivity and isolated atoms before "
#~ "retaining such configurations."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**count 和 fraction 怎么选。** 二者只选一个：想精确删几个原子用 `Vacancy "
#~ "Count`；想按体系大小等比例删用 `Vacancy Fraction`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Count or fraction?** Use `Vacancy Count` for an absolute number and "
#~ "`Vacancy Fraction` for size-scaled concentration."

#~ msgid "可复现性"
#~ msgstr "Reproducibility"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "勾选 `use_seed` + 固定 `seed` → 相同输入可复现。输入结构顺序变化也会影响结"
#~ "果。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Enable `use_seed` and fix `seed` to reproduce an input. Input order can "
#~ "also affect derived samples."
